  "totalBlocks": 12,
  "translatedBlocks": 12,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b407e05e4d6c593",
      "translationZh": "ZCode 现已开源，已报告的安全问题也已得到解决。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb391c21e55628fa",
      "translationZh": "源代码：https://github.com/zai-org/ZCode",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "957fe01bde0aaa57",
      "translationZh": "该代码仓库包含其桌面应用、Web 工作空间、后端、Agent CLI 和运行时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "735473083864df6b",
      "translationZh": "针对社区报告的 ZCode 产品安全问题，我们已完成必要的整改，并向所有用户致以诚挚的歉意。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b58015b2df79045",
      "translationZh": "我们已在 github.com/zai-org/ZCode 将 ZCode 开源，让代码接受社区审视，使 ZCode 更加开放、透明。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "018c753078f4def3",
      "translationZh": "我们衷心感谢此前发现 ZCode 问题的社区开发者。今后，我们将建立持续的产品安全漏洞报告与响应流程。欢迎开发者继续审查 ZCode 并报告潜在问题，我们将根据所报告问题的严重程度提供奖励。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2946734d11877b68",
      "translationZh": "关于社区提及的代码数据，我们确认未留存任何此类数据，且从未将其用于模型训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5be1d74e47523c71",
      "translationZh": "整改完成后，我们邀请了中国信息通信研究院（CAICT）和 NSFOCUS 开展安全评估。结果如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7cfc57b5db9a37c",
      "translationZh": "CAICT 通过技术评估确认，zcode-prod Alibaba Cloud OSS 存储桶处于零数据状态。ZCode v3.14.0 客户端已完成安全整改。Repo Wiki 功能已移除，生成和上传本地代码仓库快照的工作流程已禁用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3de6f359e254abd6",
      "translationZh": "NSFOCUS 确认，zcode-prod Alibaba Cloud OSS 存储桶中的所有数据对象以及该存储桶本身均已删除。ZCode v3.14.0 客户端已完成整改。Repo Wiki 入口及相关生成工作流程已移除，未发现任何能够触发本地代码仓库快照生成或将本地文件向外传输的功能路径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0f231af59471101",
      "translationZh": "我们再次诚挚致歉，并欢迎社区持续监督。完整的安全评估报告将于近期发布。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3145a355fa06b07f",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/ResearchCrafty1804 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
